OL,3,AJobless rate falls but small firms cut
OL,4,Aback hiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's unemployment rate has dropped
OL,7,Fto its lowest for more than year, but
OL,8,Fjob vacancies have continued to fall as
OL,9,Fsmaller businesses cut back on
OL,10,Frecruitment, official figures indicate.
OL,12,FThe jobless rate fell to 4.7% in the
OL,13,Fthree months to August, the Office for
OL,14,FNational Statistics (ONS) said, the
OL,15,Flowest since July last year.
OL,17,FHowever, vacancies fell by 21,000 in
OL,18,Fthe three months to September to
OL,19,F691,000, with the ONS saying small
OL,20,Ffirms were citing labour costs as a key
OL,21,Ffactor in scaling back hiring.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
