OL,3,AJobless rate falls but small firms cut
OL,4,Aback hiring
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe figures are the last official
OL,7,Fsnapshot of the jobs market before the
OL,8,FBudget, and analysts said they
OL,9,Findicated the jobs market was showing
OL,10,Fsigns of recovery despite the weakness
OL,11,Fin hiring.
